column35:
Also surely you could just have:<p><pre><code>  function readGIF(filename) {
    if (calcMemSizeNeeded(filename) > memoryFree()) {
      displayGifPlaceholder();
    }  
  }
</code></pre>
eg just display an animated GIF if there's enough ram, and if not, display some placeholder.<p>I guess one of the other issues there though is websites that 'stream' animated gifs that never end. Still, you could just disable those for now.
